# Final XTX before/after table (WYNIKI-XTX-2026-10-19): upstream master 4c3c5810f (~/llama-upstream, rbuild gfx1100)
# vs topka (~/llama-topka via run-topka.sh). Run: ~/qwen-opt/queue/run-jobs.sh ~/qwen-opt/bench-final/final.jobs
# Arms: U0 upstream `-m` only | U1 upstream + production flags (+ its own MTP n=4 for Qwen) | T topka.
# Order per model: llama-bench U T T U, then server pass 1 U0 U1 T, pass 2 T U1 U0 (A/B/B/A). Ports 18701-18703.
# Logs: ~/qwen-opt/bench-final/logs/ (summary: fb_summary.py). Estimated GPU time ~95 min.
fb-lb-qwen|900|~/qwen-opt/bench-final|./fb_lb.sh qwen "U T T U"
